<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Mirror of win-appcast.xml for networks where GitHub is unreachable; the app falls back to
     this feed via jsDelivr. jsDelivr refuses to serve .exe files, so the enclosure goes through
     a GitHub download proxy instead — swap the proxy host here any time it stops working; no
     app update is needed. The Ed25519 signature check protects the download against tampering
     regardless of which host serves it. Keep the newest item(s) in sync with win-appcast.xml
     when releasing (same signature and length; only the URL differs).
     Items up to v0.2.0 predate the move from the clipboardSyncRelease repo into this repo and
     keep their original download URLs; that repo stays online to serve them. -->
